Third-party data attribution
============================

The source code in this repository is MIT licensed (see LICENSE).

The dataset sample committed at data/sample/uci_credit_sample.csv is a 5,000-row
class-stratified draw from the UCI Machine Learning Repository dataset 350,
"Default of Credit Card Clients", which is distributed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).

Required attribution:

  Yeh, I. C., & Lien, C. H. (2009). The comparisons of data mining techniques for
  the predictive accuracy of probability of default of credit card clients.
  Expert Systems with Applications, 36(2), 2473-2480.

  UCI Machine Learning Repository, dataset 350.
  https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/350/default+of+credit+card+clients

Licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

No changes were made to the underlying records. The sample differs from the source
only by row subsetting and by the positional column rename documented in
financial_ai_framework/data/loader.py, which maps the upstream X1..X23 / Y names to
the canonical names used in the source paper.
